[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1984245155","pull_request_review_id":2665940832,"id":1984245155,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc52RS2j","diff_hunk":"@@ -337,6 +337,9 @@ void GameView::_stop_pressed() {\n void GameView::_embedding_completed() {\n \t_attach_script_debugger();\n \t_update_ui();\n+\tif (bool(GLOBAL_GET(\"display/window/size/always_on_top\"))) {","path":"editor/plugins/game_view_plugin.cpp","commit_id":"afe47b68502ebfe0b06b3fbce085173bf99beece","original_commit_id":"010691e41770d3c8f2b11a291d637968db28bbdc","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Good thinking to access the floating window using `get_window()`!\r\n\r\nI suggest to moved this to the end of the `_show_update_window_wrapper` method, after the `window_wrapper->restore_window_from_saved_position` to keep all the settings for the floating window at the same place. That will prevent to update the always on top flag when not using the floating window. Currently, the always on top flag is set for the editor window when not using the floating window. Also, that way, when updating the project settings, the always on top will be updated even while the game is running because `_show_update_window_wrapper`  is called in `GameView::_editor_or_project_settings_changed`.\r\n\r\nI also suggest always settings the flag to be able to set it to false if the setting is modified in the project settings.\r\nSomething like:\r\n```cpp\r\nget_window()->set_flag(bool(GLOBAL_GET(\"display/window/size/always_on_top\")));\r\n```\r\n","created_at":"2025-03-07T00:49:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T00:51:28Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103731#discussion_r1984245155","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103731","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1984245155"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103731#discussion_r1984245155"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103731"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1984245155/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":340,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1984265881","pull_request_review_id":2665971493,"id":1984265881,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc52RX6Z","diff_hunk":"@@ -337,6 +337,9 @@ void GameView::_stop_pressed() {\n void GameView::_embedding_completed() {\n \t_attach_script_debugger();\n \t_update_ui();\n+\tif (bool(GLOBAL_GET(\"display/window/size/always_on_top\"))) {","path":"editor/plugins/game_view_plugin.cpp","commit_id":"afe47b68502ebfe0b06b3fbce085173bf99beece","original_commit_id":"010691e41770d3c8f2b11a291d637968db28bbdc","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Thanks for the tips. I've changed it to only set the flag when the embed is a floating window now.\r\n\r\nBut unfortunately changing the location of the flag makes it not work. \r\nI was trying to set the ALWAYS_ON_TOP flag around the `_instance_starting` and `_show_update_window_wrapper` at first. But no matter what I did it didn't seen to have any effect. \r\n\r\nThe only way I got it working was to do it **after the embedding happens**.\r\nMy best guess is that the `embed_process` call somehow changes the window_id, or affects it in some way that makes the always on top flag invalid.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f2cc3f12750adae431384d7bac2f75d1c7e506be/editor/plugins/embedded_process.cpp#L204-L210","created_at":"2025-03-07T01:23:04Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T01:23:04Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103731#discussion_r1984265881","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103731","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1984265881"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103731#discussion_r1984265881"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103731"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1984265881/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":340,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1984245155,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]